# {{ project_name }} agent workflow

## Responsibility map

- GitHub Issues and pull requests define work, progress, and evidence. Approved specs and ADRs preserve durable context; add a plan only for cross-session, high-risk, or hard-to-recover work, and never store raw chat transcripts. Follow the [`.csarc/docs/csarc.md` workflow](csarc.md#工作流程) for work items.
- Root `AGENTS.md` is the discovery entry point, this file is its single detailed CSARC workflow, and `.claude/CLAUDE.md` only imports the root entry point.
- One writable task uses one Git branch and one worktree so concurrent changes stay isolated.
{% if verification_mode != 'hosted' %}- Run focused checks while iterating, then run `./.csarc/scripts/verify-fast` once on the committed final candidate; it records self-attested evidence bound to the clean exact head/tree, base, tier, and freshness. This is not hosted or release provenance. See [`.csarc/docs/ci-policy.md`](ci-policy.md#本機與-hosted-驗證模式).
{% else %}- Run focused checks for the owners you touched; do not rerun the aggregate suite solely because the hosted plan selects `full`. The required hosted `verify` check selects the tier from trusted base code and runs it once on the exact candidate; local full is reserved for a documented fallback or explicit diagnostic and never substitutes for hosted evidence. See [`.csarc/docs/ci-policy.md`](ci-policy.md#驗證分級).
{% endif %}- [`.csarc/docs/ci-policy.md`](ci-policy.md#審查與合併資格) owns review requirements, merge eligibility, and configured admin bypass{% if verification_mode == 'hosted' %}; its [failure section](ci-policy.md#failure-與-fallback) owns the Actions-outage governance-switch route{% endif %}; the former quota fallback is retired. Do not restate or invent exceptions here.
- Template updates follow the [`.csarc/docs/csarc.md` update contract](csarc.md#公版更新).

